# ========================
# Level6 adapter-generation sandbox (D18)
# ========================
# The provisioned sandbox interpreter: a ~35MB standalone Python tree plus the
# vetted dependency closure, rebuilt on demand from
# AgentCore/policy/adapter_sandbox_dependencies.yaml. It is a build artifact
# keyed by a manifest digest, never a source of truth -- committing it would
# freeze a copy of the host's packages into the repository.
projects/.sandbox_env/
# Per-run sandbox workspaces containing generated code.
projects/sandbox_level6/
projects/test_sandbox/
projects/_isolation_tests/

# ========================
# System-specific automation artifacts
# ========================
screenshots/
ui_dumps/
# Runtime chat logs
chat_hystory.txt
